{{!
    @template local_oksigeniaeguahe/panel_centre

    The settings of a centre (centre.php), without the look of a form: every setting is a gesture of the world of Eguahe.

    Two stretches. «Every day»: the offer (shelves and cards, panel_offer_card), the people (cards that hang from the
    rail when the families see them, with their face, their sentence and the rest on the back) and Telegram and
    WhatsApp (three choices, and what goes by itself to the channel as stops on a line of time). «Set once»: folded
    cards, each with what it has now in one line (built here from the context) and «Change» to open it: how families
    see the centre (the band and the wall in light and dark, the name written on the band itself), the address and
    contact, the country and the system, after enrolling, the data of the families, the area, the networks, the skin
    of the panel, what families share and the AI.

    Saving. The page is one form and every button sends all of it, so panel_centre::save() saves everything posted as
    before; there is no common «Save» at the foot. A switch, a chip or a choice carries what it has now as a hidden field
    and, after it, a button with the same name and the value it changes to: PHP keeps the last one, so one touch saves
    it. Text is saved with the «Save» of its card (name guardar, the only one that says «Changes saved»), or with any
    other gesture. Each button comes back to its part (formaction with #aj-key; the redirect keeps that anchor). With JavaScript, a photo, a logo or a choice in a select saves itself (data-envio-solo).
    The form has novalidate: the server keeps the name when it comes empty, and says so when an address is not one.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * i - icons; head - panel_head; action - the address of the form (with ?year= when another school year is shown)
    * sesskey, name, colour, lightvars, darkvars, colourguard, logo, logoplate, initial, hanging - how families see it
    * lang, countries, currencies, systems - options (value, name, selected)
    * address, phone, email, welcome, arrive, replydays (options), replyread (panel_read_replies), hastales, libraries
    * hosts - everyone of the team: id (member), userid, me, name, first, picture, initials, role, shown, phrase
    * hasmessaging, messaging (value, name, help, checked), channel (as panel_kit)
    * handover (options), handoverplace, handoverhow, siblingages (options), invitegone
    * firstday (Y-m-d), firstdaydate (public_date), firstdayleaf (weekday, day, month) or false, namephrase,
      namephraseexample
    * apply - how a family asks for a place: how, url, written, fromdate and untildate (public_date), fromleaf and
      untilleaf (weekday, day, month) or false
    * controller, rights, dpo, retentions (options: value, name, selected)
    * municipalities, areaplaces (names), networks, networklist (names)
    * oferta - the offer (see panel_offer_card), or false without a school system
    * skins, skinproposal, ai, share

    Example context (json):
